    <string name="osservio_crash_hint">The recorder captured a fatal BSD signal at whole-second precision. Stack addresses are best effort and are not symbolicated. Missing frames and images are not reconstructed; a signal alone does not identify the underlying cause.</string>
    <string name="osservio_crash_frames_hint">Newest frame first. The thread index is local to this report, not an OS thread ID. Reaching the recording limit can mean that frames are missing.</string>
    <string name="osservio_crash_images_hint">UUIDs identify binary builds for matching symbol files. A zero extent means the size was unavailable. Neither a shorter list nor an unflagged cache proves complete image coverage.</string>
